		{
			"id": "tv8UhV9yXeMlEB0Tz",
			"name": "Psychic Scream (Hive Mind)",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The Hive Mind's own version of a psyker's mind-shattering shout: a silent wave of alien horror and noise that stuns everyone nearby, distinct from — and stackable with — Shadow in the Warp's constant ambient dread. Consistent Codex background naming Psychic Scream as a Zoanthrope-tier ability across several editions.\n\nDesign: Affliction (10/level, delivering the default Stun effect) with Area Effect (+50%) plus Warp Sorcery/Perils, net +20% — identical build to this project's own Telepathy: Psychic Scream entry, reused here under the Hive Mind's own name per that entry's own \"Hive Mind flavour\" note in framework.md. Full modified cost: 10 x 1.2 = 12 points/level; needs Warp Empowerment level 2 (cap 30).",
